00:01:27.413 --> 00:01:28.246
- Yeah, you need a--

00:01:28.246 --> 00:01:29.210
- Though, like in real life?
- Well, well?

00:01:29.210 --> 00:01:30.043
- It could be.
- Well, see,

00:01:30.043 --> 00:01:31.748
but you know me, like don't ever get,

00:01:31.748 --> 00:01:33.246
I'm always wisecracking.

00:01:33.246 --> 00:01:34.389
I'm so annoying.

00:01:34.389 --> 00:01:35.916
I'm your little insane sidekick.

00:01:35.916 --> 00:01:38.026
- (laughs) Insane wisecracking annoying.

00:01:38.026 --> 00:01:39.286
