00:02:11.619 --> 00:02:12.664
- I'm gonna go with out of pride.

00:02:12.664 --> 00:02:14.031
- I'm gonna go with to obtain power.

00:02:14.031 --> 00:02:16.543
- [Sofia] What is the best
accessory a villain can have?

00:02:16.543 --> 00:02:17.513
- [Dove] I feel like I'm in the middle

00:02:17.513 --> 00:02:18.346
of two, like, genuine villains.

00:02:18.346 --> 00:02:20.282
- You are (scoffs).

00:02:20.282 --> 00:02:22.076
- A staff, sorry guys.

00:02:22.076 --> 00:02:23.579
- Yeah, Maleficent has a staff.

00:02:23.579 --> 00:02:24.676
